{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58d219aa9dc5a833d5bd3","chatId":"dd6ab599b087461893f01a62a8b5aeb3","sessionId":null,"userId":95349,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2519,"promptTokens":2222,"completionTokens":70,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:55:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0028004257180322405,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58d219aa9dc5a833d5bd2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477345532,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:55:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58d219aa9dc5a833d5bd2","chatId":"dd6ab599b087461893f01a62a8b5aeb3","sessionId":null,"userId":95349,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n亮亮、原原和晓晓都是学校的同学，下周一是晓晓的生日。今天，当晓晓在上课时， 亮亮和原原在走廊里交头接耳。亮亮看着手里的手机，不时地检查周围的环境。然后，他轻轻地笑了一下，并对原原做了一个OK的手势。原原看了一眼教室的窗户，然后回头对亮亮点了点头。后来，当晓晓走出教室时，他发现亮亮和原原正在低声交谈，并偶尔朝他看看。\n\n[问题]\n你认为晓晓看到亮亮和原原在低声交谈，并时不时看向他，他可能会有什么感觉？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 晓晓可能无动于衷，只是认为他们在聊天或是做功课。\nB. 晓晓可能会感到好奇和困惑，想要知道他们准备对他做什么。\nC. 晓晓可能会感到恐惧和不安，认为他们在背后说他坏话。\nD. 晓晓可能会感到愤怒，因为晓晓觉得他们有事瞒着自己，没有把自己当朋友。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0028004257180322405,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58d219aa9dc5a833d5bd3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477345529,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:55:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4cc51f8a6d8d4752aa04895e05bff1ba"}